     "titulo": "Dialogue: preparing a cultural presentation",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "介绍「节日、艺术与休闲」时，怎样帮助观众了解它的背景？",
       "alumno": "When presenting «celebrations, art and leisure», how would you help the audience understand its background?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以先做一个简单的计划。",
       "alumno": "We can start with a simple plan.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "要是中间出了问题怎么办？",
       "alumno": "What if a problem comes up along the way?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "到时候再调整，先把眼前的事情做好。",
       "alumno": "We'll adjust later; first let's do well what's in front of us.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: preparing a cultural presentation",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "了解「节日、艺术与休闲」不只是记住名称和年代。",
       "alumno": "Knowing «celebrations, art and leisure» is not just a matter of memorising names and dates.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "还要了解它与当时社会生活的联系，并比较不同的解释。",
       "alumno": "You also need to relate it to the social life of its time and compare different interpretations.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果条件发生变化，原来的决定也可以重新考虑。",
       "alumno": "If circumstances change, the original decision can also be reconsidered.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
